      "title": "Cadence Q3 Earnings Beat Estimates on AI Demand, Outlook Raised",
      "summary": "Cadence Design Systems (CDNS) delivered strong Q3 2026 results with EPS of $2.11 beating estimates by 3.4% and revenues jumping 22% year-over-year to $1.633 billion. AI-driven demand lifted core EDA revenues 20%, semiconductor IP 24%, and System Design 30%. The company raised its 2026 revenue outlook to $6.387-$6.417 billion and EPS guidance to $8.37-$8.43, supported by record backlog of $8.2 billion and accelerating AI adoption.",
