      "title": "Cadence Q3 Earnings Call Highlights AI Expansion and Higher Outlook",
      "summary": "Cadence Design Systems (CDNS) raised its 2026 revenue guidance to $6.387-$6.417 billion and non-GAAP EPS to $8.37-$8.43, driven by accelerating AI adoption, over 100 AI Super Agent customer engagements, and a record $8.2 billion backlog. Core EDA revenues grew 20% year-over-year with recurring revenues up 18%, while the company's Maestro AI models demonstrated 30% higher quality than general-purpose models.",
